---
const installationUrl = 'https://docs.foldergram.app/installation';
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <p class="eyebrow">free &amp; open source <i style="font-style:normal;color:var(--acc)">/</i> self-hosted <i style="font-style:normal;color:var(--acc)">/</i> <b>AGPL-3.0</b></p>
  <h1>Your photos. Your videos. <em class="grad">Your own social feed.</em></h1>
  <p class="sub">Foldergram is a free, open-source, <strong>self-hosted photo and video gallery</strong> with an Instagram-inspired experience. Turn your existing folders into a personal feed, Reels, Stories and more, without moving your original files.</p>
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="btn primary" href={installationUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v12m-5-5 5 5 5-5M4 16v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h14a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4"/></svg>
      Get Started
    </a>
    <a class="btn ghost" href="https://demo.foldergram.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="m10 8 6 4-6 4Z"/></svg>
      Live Demo
    </a>
  </div>
  <p class="demo-cap hero-preview-link"><a class="js-demo" href="#demo" id="ctaDemo">Explore the interactive preview ↓</a></p>
</section>
